---
code: field.name.pascal-case
description: Convert field names to UpperCamelCase, keeping acronyms as one word (URLValue -> UrlValue)
default-enabled: false
---

# Mainstream UpperCamelCase (PascalCase): shares the word splitter used by the
# other field.name strategies (user_name -> UserName, URLValue -> UrlValue).
field.name=groovy:```
    return tool.toPascalCase(it.fieldName())
```
